codex
Da ghi report vao [reports/phase2/backwpup-phase2.codex.json](/Volumes/External_Disk/timo/WORDPRESS-PLUGIN-RESEARCH/reports/phase2/backwpup-phase2.codex.json). JSON da duoc validate bang `jq`.

Tom tat ket qua:
- `overall_risk`: `medium`
- `2` true positives, `4` false positives, `0` needs review
- Khong co TP unauth/subscriber. Hai TP deu la broken authorization tren custom role `backwpup_check`, nen dat `patchstack_eligible: false`

Hai TP duoc giu lai:
- `BWPUP-P2-001`: `backwpup_check` co the goi cac REST route chi check `current_user_can('backwpup')` de sua cloud storage config trong `backwpup_jobs`, sau do trigger backup de exfiltrate backup sang storage do attacker kiem soat.
- `BWPUP-P2-002`: `backwpup_check` co the goi REST bulk delete route du chi thieu `backwpup_backups_delete`, dan toi xoa backup file.

Bon signal Phase 1 da bi refute thanh FP: backup download, `ajax_working` LFI, log read, va low-priv site option update.
diff --git a//Volumes/External_Disk/timo/WORDPRESS-PLUGIN-RESEARCH/reports/phase2/backwpup-phase2.codex.json b//Volumes/External_Disk/timo/WORDPRESS-PLUGIN-RESEARCH/reports/phase2/backwpup-phase2.codex.json
new file mode 100644
